    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Those two copy calls turns:\r\n- docs/index.html\r\n- docs/*\r\n\r\ninto\r\n- docs/v2/*\r\n- docs/index.html\r\n\r\nWhich is what we want to have in production too.\r\n\r\nSo that this is exactly the setup that will be used in every env (dev, preview, production). Leaving few differences between those envs, ensuring that if we use paths like a href etc then dev, preview or production will behave the same.\r\n\r\nWe could even move further and even in dev have /instantsearch.js/v2 to remove some env differences.\r\n\r\nUltimately we then push the docs/ folder to gh-pages.\r\n\r\nOther possibilities would have been to only modify the gh-pages script and do the moves there but that would have been a bit too magical I felt and error prone.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you want to change it.",
    "commit_id": "71077dc804757d891036e9c01ba42512e1f838b5",
